DTEND:20250522T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20250522T033000Z
UID:5av3M7EhTC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nWhen two local women set out to 
 decolonize Nairobi’s formerly whites-only McMillan Memorial Library and 
 turn it into a multicultural hub\, they must contend with their country’
 s history and a complicated web of bureaucracy over eight very long but re
 warding years. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/how-to-build
 -a-library\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • AMC Pacific Place 11 (Fri 16 May\, 1
 :30 PM)
